<p id="p1.2" class="ltx_p"><sup id="p1.2.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="p1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>Graduate School of Information Science and Engineering, Ritsumeikan University, Osaka, Japan
<br class="ltx_break">(E-mail: { hashimoto.saki, hasegawa.shoichi, ishikawa.tomochika } @em.ci.ritsumei.ac.jp)
<br class="ltx_break"><sup id="p1.2.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="p1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">2</span></sup>College of Information Science and Engineering, Ritsumeikan University, Osaka, Japan
<br class="ltx_break">(E-mail: a.taniguchi@em.ci.ritsumei.ac.jp)
