<math id="S4.T1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nu_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ν</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nu_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.T1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.T1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.T1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Hyperparameters of the model</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Index of an object</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Total number of objects obtained during prior exploration</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.1.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Index of an ownership concept</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.1.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Total number of ownership concepts</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.13.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.1.13.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Index of a position distribution component</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.14.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T1.1.14.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Total number of position distribution components</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p6.1" class="ltx_p">To incrementally update the ownership distribution in answer to sequential observations, we adopt an online learning approach using a Rao-Blackwellized Particle Filter (RBPF) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">19</a>]</cite>, following the framework of SpCoAE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">2</a>]</cite>.
The robot treats the object’s position, attributes, and the user’s answer as multimodal observations and performs sequential inference of the posterior distribution over ownership.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS3.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p7.1" class="ltx_p">The joint posterior distribution of all parameters estimated during ownership learning is factorized using Bayes’ theorem.
Following the derivation presented in SpCoAE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">2</a>]</cite>, the particle weight update equation can be expressed as follows:</p>
<table id="S4.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_left_padleft"></td>
<td colspan="2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;p(x_{n},o_{n},w_{n}|C_{1:n-1},i_{1:n-1},x_{1:n-1},o_{1:n-1},w_{1:n-1},h)\\
&amp;\quad=\sum_{C_{n}}\sum_{i_{n}}p(x_{n}|x_{1:n-1},i_{1:n},h)p(o_{n}|o_{1:n-1},C_{1:n},\alpha)\\
&amp;\quad\quad\times p(w_{n}|w_{1:n-1},C_{1:n},\beta)\\
&amp;\quad\quad\times p(C_{1:n},i_{1:n}|C_{1:n-1},i_{1:n-1},\gamma,\lambda)\end{split}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>w</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>w</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>w</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{split}&amp;p(x_{n},o_{n},w_{n}|C_{1:n-1},i_{1:n-1},x_{1:n-1},o_{1:n-1},w_{1:n-1},h)\\
&amp;\quad=\sum_{C_{n}}\sum_{i_{n}}p(x_{n}|x_{1:n-1},i_{1:n},h)p(o_{n}|o_{1:n-1},C_{1:n},\alpha)\\
&amp;\quad\quad\times p(w_{n}|w_{1:n-1},C_{1:n},\beta)\\
&amp;\quad\quad\times p(C_{1:n},i_{1:n}|C_{1:n-1},i_{1:n-1},\gamma,\lambda)\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_left_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.SS3.p7.2" class="ltx_p">Based on this equation, particles are resampled according to their weights <math id="S4.SS3.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega_{n}</annotation></semantics></math>.
During the initial exploration phase, the robot does not ask any questions; therefore, <math id="S4.SS3.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{n}</annotation></semantics></math> is treated as uninformative.
After question generation begins, the probabilistic generative model is updated by incorporating the user’s answer <math id="S4.SS3.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{n}</annotation></semantics></math>, enabling the learning of ownership knowledge.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.4 </span>Acquiring ownership knowledge via User-Directed Question Generation</h3>

<div id="S4.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To efficiently acquire ownership knowledge, the proposed method calculates IG for each object and selects the one expected to most effectively reduce uncertainty.
For the selected object, a natural language question is generated using LLM, and an answer is obtained from the user.</p>
</div>
<section id="S4.SS4.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">4.4.1 </span>Object Selection Based on IG</h4>

<div id="S4.SS4.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For objects identified as owned belongings, the next object to query is selected based on its expected IG.
The overall algorithm for the proposed method is presented in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ 4.4.1 Object Selection Based on IG ‣ 4.4 Acquiring ownership knowledge via User-Directed Question Generation ‣ 4 Proposed Method ‣ Toward Ownership Understanding of Objects: Active Question Generation with Large Language Model and Probabilistic Generative Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.
Here, <span id="S4.SS4.SSS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">UPDATE-MODEL</span> denotes the RBPF-based update step, which takes the current set of observations <math id="S4.SS4.SSS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x_{n},o_{n},w_{n})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x_{n},o_{n},w_{n})</annotation></semantics></math> and sequentially updates the posterior distribution of ownership concepts and model parameters.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_figure ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="alg1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Active Exploration Algorithm for Ownership Acquisition</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.3" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                
               <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{-1}=\text{UPDATE-MODEL}\big(\{w_{a}=\text{unknown}\mid\forall a\}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>UPDATE-MODEL</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>unknown</mtext></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{-1}=\text{UPDATE-MODEL}\big(\{w_{a}=\text{unknown}\mid\forall a\}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                
               Identify shared objects via LLM; set <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{a}=\text{Shared}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>Shared</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{a}=\text{Shared}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                
               <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{0}=\text{UPDATE-MODEL}\big(\{w_{a}\in\{\text{unknown, Shared}\}\mid\forall a\}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>UPDATE-MODEL</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mtext>unknown, Shared</mtext><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{0}=\text{UPDATE-MODEL}\big(\{w_{a}\in\{\text{unknown, Shared}\}\mid\forall a\}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                
               <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{0}=\{a\mid w_{a}=\text{Shared}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>Shared</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{0}=\{a\mid w_{a}=\text{Shared}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{n_{0}}=\{w_{a}\mid a\in n_{0}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{n_{0}}=\{w_{a}\mid a\in n_{0}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                
               <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                
                <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for all</span> detected objects <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{a},o_{a}\in\mathbb{R}^{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>D</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{a},o_{a}\in\mathbb{R}^{D}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
                
                 <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
                
                  <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>J</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
                
                   <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{a}^{[r,j]}\sim\text{Multinomial}(p=\hat{p}(w_{a}|Z^{[r]},W_{n_{0}}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mtext>Multinomial</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{a}^{[r,j]}\sim\text{Multinomial}(p=\hat{p}(w_{a}|Z^{[r]},W_{n_{0}}))</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                
                  <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
